cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ASCEND, please cite the archived software release."
title: "ASCEND: A Verification-Gated DevSecOps Framework with AI-Assisted Synchronization"
abstract: >-
  ASCEND is a four-layer DevSecOps framework that integrates static, dynamic,
  dependency, and infrastructure-as-code scanning as build gates, aggregates
  heterogeneous scanner outputs through a configurable composite quality-gate
  rule, and adds a verification-gated post-deployment synchronization loop that
  filters LLM-proposed merge-conflict resolutions through property-based checks
  before pull-request creation. Evaluation is reproducible from public inputs.
type: software
